<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sappi year share plunges.</title>
<headline>Sappi year share plunges.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Sept 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     230	   vs  846</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 140	   vs  -</p>
<p>    Net income		404	   vs  1,356</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   531	   vs  1,684</p>
<p>    Tax			  36	   vs  192</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   684	   vs  535</p>
<p>    Turnover	     15,271	   vs 13,258</p>
<p>Full name: Sappi Ltd.</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors will award capitalisation shares, details of which will be announced no later than January 6. Analysts polled by Reuters forecast earnings per share on a range of 200 to 320 cents with consensus at 266.6 cents a share. They expected a dividend of 90.0 cents a share.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
